<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2496" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱμύλος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			7.643
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Crin.
		</span></i>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wheedling,
				wily</i>, mostly of words, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱμύλα κωτίλλουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					374
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῦθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					8.33
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				687
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ. μηχαναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					208
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ κλωπὸς αἴνει φωτὸς αἱμύλον δόρυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					709
				</span></i>
			; of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν αἱμυλώτατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					389
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				237b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1124
			</span></i>; of foxes, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				1268
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
